Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說好的一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:06.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行了行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這拂塵的毛都快抹我一臉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:14.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:17.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要回鬼市了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是也要回仙京了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要是想跟我回鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:26.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:28.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:31.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有機會你重修極樂坊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去給你搬磚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搬磚不必
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你坐著看也挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是多謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎樣才是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:52.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或許
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:54.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這樣也未嘗不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:55.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你只管做就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:14.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,挺夠意思的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是怎麼結交到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你運氣可真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:24.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:28.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也這麼覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:38.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對不住啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,技不如人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒什麼好說的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,進去確認一下還有沒有漏網之魚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱們就回仙京吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:03.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城居然倒打一耙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說上天庭在鬼市安插眼線
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,荒謬至極
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們天界需要在他手下安插眼線
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您話可別說這麼早
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風師大人回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次去鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,風師大人您辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:50.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以往
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一兩個月都不一定開一場集議
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:54.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今事故頻發
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恨不得一天議兩次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:59.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也怪不得帝君疲累了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這血雨探花說來就來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說走還就能走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:05.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天他能輕而易舉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把得罪他的太子殿下抓走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明天豈不是也能抓走別的神官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這事萬萬不能姑息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,必須得及時遏止啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城坐擁一個鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,信徒那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,會在乎區區一個極樂坊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:20.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我看吶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不一定是因為太子殿下得罪了他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才闖仙京的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:27.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄真將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這話就不對了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家可都是親耳聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城自己承認了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說起來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本月是輪到哪位將軍守庭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:40.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂宮的大門給人施了法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:41.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,連到別處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然毫無察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,算不算失職
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本月當值的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,的確是我失職了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:05:59.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,依我看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,事情還是一件件來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先把血洗鎏金宴的事弄清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰華殿下有消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:12.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:14.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安國鎏金宴之事另有隱情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他會自行處理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,望旁人不要插手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:21.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼隱情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,具體沒說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只提了句
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,務必不要讓太子殿下自貶成功
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-這究竟是為何呀\N-泰華殿下是何用意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,苦主都不找凶手討債了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們還在這起什麼勁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:38.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而且泰華殿下似乎也不願說內情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真是連點嚼頭都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:43.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南陽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們一同協助明光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,加強仙京警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其餘人等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:52.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,繼續排查
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:56.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想不到這仙樂太子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,每次捅出什麼婁子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:06:59.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君說要審
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之後都不了了之
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原來是尊大佛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有眼不識泰山
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:06.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今後說話小心點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:14.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又給您添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:19.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這還不算什麼麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你若是一直咬死了血洗鎏金宴的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那才真的麻煩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:28.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其實
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:42.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,事情的原委
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:43.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這事做得真是吃力不討好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,裡外不是人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你一貫如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:59.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰華現在是去追青鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但之後如何應對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還沒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過眼下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:07.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我在想點別的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:08.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什麼有趣點的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,讓我也高興一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,地師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是您派去鬼市臥底的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:20.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是為何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因為先對天界出手的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是花城
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:28.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼多年來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:31.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城的消息都太快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太精準了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼事可以做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼事不可以做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪裡是底線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何擦邊壓線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那些他本不應該知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他都一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次更是直接把通道開到了你的仙樂宮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:52.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若說上天庭沒有他安插的內應
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又如何能解釋這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您有證據嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是苦於沒有確鑿的證據
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我才讓明儀混入鬼界的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:08.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上天庭那隻內鬼還沒揪出來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:13.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明儀反倒落入他手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次萬幸被你救了回來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但要再尋花城的眼線
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恐怕就更加困難了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出了問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是上天庭還是中天庭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:26.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你便當除了你之外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰都有可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也許
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:33.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:34.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也許
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,更多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:40.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就算是風信慕情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,任何人都有可能嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:49.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道你現在一定對花城頗有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但還是要多留個心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別把什麼底都透給他了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世間能成絕者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,無一不是經歷了非常人所能忍受的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要嘛一飛沖天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:04.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要嘛萬劫不復
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能從銅爐山裡出來的絕境鬼王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都遠比你想像得要可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:14.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知花城的目的和動向是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但他卻對上天庭瞭如指掌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就很不利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:22.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該不會做太過火的事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,畢竟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以他的實力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是要為禍作亂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,豈不是早就能攪個天翻地覆了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然從前不會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:35.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那不出意外
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想必
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今後也不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:41.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但願如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為了三界蒼生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不能冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,皇兒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:25.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:26.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安樂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:27.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你師父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱們三個仙樂人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都有份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是我的父皇母后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安和仙樂融合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原本是他們最大的心願
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:39.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇母后的心願實現了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:46.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他們的下場又是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恨一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難道不比恨一群人好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受什麼我也是活該
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正我也死不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全算在我一個人頭上不好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果子可好吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:21.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:22.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不騙你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:23.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又甜又水靈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次帶你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:30.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,攥拳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:35.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,手抬高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:37.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,腿要穩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沖拳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:42.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,發力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:45.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:49.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,推掌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:51.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,換步要快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:30.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:31.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對不住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:36.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我忘了帶東西來看你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我遇到戚容了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:43.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這幾百年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:46.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知他究竟經歷了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:47.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,化成了鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還害死了好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在有人要殺他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上天庭大概也饒不了他了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是真不知該拿這個人怎麼辦了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,娘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:11.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是妳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:14.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:17.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后早在八百年前便脫離了苦海
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,從不曾化為冤魂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:37.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼是個孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我母后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:40.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我母后在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:42.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:45.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你把我母后的屍身弄到哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:40.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盜墓賊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:43.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎麼進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:45.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:49.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滾出來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:17:59.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要殺了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:04.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又見面啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要丟下谷子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:28.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,表哥你生什麼氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我捅你一下你又不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我母后對你如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:34.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就這樣對她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼對待她的屍骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:38.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姨母早就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:46.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人都沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,屍體是人是粉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有區別嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過是屍體換了個模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不還在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:18:58.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哭哭啼啼的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:01.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當初對安樂倒下得了狠手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:04.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好表哥居然有兩副臉孔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我為什麼這麼對她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還不都是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這個瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有臉到仙樂皇陵來哭喪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:18.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對 對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這樣才是你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,狠狠地打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:24.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,狠狠地殺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,少裝得一副忍辱負重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:28.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-爹爹 爹爹你怎麼了\N-有苦難言的聖人樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:30.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-爹爹\N-看得人噁心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給我自己滾出來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:37.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,信不信我拽著你舌頭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把你魂魄拉出來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不滾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:41.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒是你來拽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正這附身的也是個雜碎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,肯定不會讓你太子殿下的聖潔光輝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有絲毫受損
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可是把你媽都輾成灰了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不殺我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不殺我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:00.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,錯過了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-你一輩子都別想找到我的骨灰\N-別殺我爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別殺我爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:15.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,失敗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何其的失敗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-還口口聲聲愛你的爹媽\N-閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在骨灰都給人揚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:23.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:24.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然還下不了手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:25.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:29.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,露出你真實的嘴臉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:33.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世上會有人比我更懂你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可太清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:41.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你現在雖然一副喪家犬的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但其實呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:45.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,心裡還是那麼驕傲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:47.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,容不得別人說三道四
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我說你失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你心裡一定恨死我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是不是刺得心都在滴血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就來殺了我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是說因為這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就不敢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,讓我看看你到底會怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:29.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我曾以為我做了對的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:30.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可現在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道什麼是對的了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:36.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你能不能告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:38.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我到底哪裡做得不夠好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是哪一步出了問題
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:45.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那第三個人的糧食也不夠怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:49.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那兩個人有了糧食
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:50.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-卻因為貪\N-安樂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:51.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-想要更多\N-你知不知道你犯下了大錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:52.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-打得更凶\N-原來你是國師
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不斷向第三個人索取糧食
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-那又該怎麼辦啊\N-你藏得也太深了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:21:57.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:00.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們可以一起去幹一番大事業
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在洗了鎏金宴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再去殺了郎千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:07.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,攪得永安翻天覆地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永無安寧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:12.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽我的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:15.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殺永安王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保仙樂遺民
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:18.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殺安樂王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:20.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保兩族不再起紛爭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:21.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最後
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:23.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死於郎千秋之手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凶手伏誅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三條人命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,換幾世太平
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:30.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我也會這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:34.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰也不會做得比你更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:36.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要把某個人想像得太過美好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若一輩子只是遠觀倒也罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:46.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一旦靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.29,0:22:48.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,相識相知
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:52.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,完美的幻影終究會有破碎的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.13,0:22:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到那時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你會很失望的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:01.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去你的仙樂太子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你祖祖輩輩世世代代都是仙樂太子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:05.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:06.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他就是個瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:08.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把我妻兒的命還回來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:09.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還命來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.17,0:23:12.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:15.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正很快就會沒人記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:25.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:28.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不會忘的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.13,0:23:34.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我永遠也不會忘了你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.71,0:23:55.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:57.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想陪你走到最後
